flowchart TD
    Request[Read Request: list_logs / get_stats / get_issues] --> CheckCache{Cache.get key}
    
    CheckCache -- Cache Hit --> ReturnCache[Return JSON Parsed Cached Data]
    CheckCache -- Cache Miss / Offline --> QueryDB[Execute Database Query via SQLAlchemy]
    
    QueryDB --> SetCache[Cache.set key, expire_seconds=10]
    SetCache --> ReturnDB[Return Database Result Data]
    
    WriteAction[Write Request: create_log / delete_log] --> ExecWrite[Execute DB Insert / Delete]
    ExecWrite --> PurgeCache[Cache.forget logs:stats, logs:trends, logs:issues, etc.]
    PurgeCache --> ReturnWriteSuccess[Return Operation Success Response]
